WEBVTT

00:01.510 --> 00:03.550
Previously on "Final Space"...

00:03.580 --> 00:05.070
Gary and Quinn go
on their first date

00:05.100 --> 00:06.550
while the Earth is being
sucked up into the breach.

00:06.590 --> 00:07.900
Holy crap!

00:07.930 --> 00:09.730
Gary finds
the anti-matter bomb,

00:09.760 --> 00:11.210
But to detonate it,
they're gonna have to get past

00:11.250 --> 00:13.320
the Lord Commander's
fleet of incinerators.

00:13.350 --> 00:14.940
Can they save the world?

00:14.980 --> 00:19.980
Get ready for the epic season
finale of "Final Space"!

00:23.470 --> 00:31.370
♪♪

00:31.410 --> 00:39.070
♪♪

00:39.100 --> 00:41.590
Lord Commander:
Do these fools really think

00:41.620 --> 00:44.590
that I'll allow them
to close the breach?

00:44.630 --> 00:48.630
I was chosen by Titans.

00:48.660 --> 00:50.630
Gary: We might not
make it out of this.

00:50.670 --> 00:53.980
I wanted to say...
I don't know what we are.

00:54.010 --> 00:55.190
A crew?

00:55.220 --> 00:56.600
Feels like we're more than that.

00:56.640 --> 00:58.360
I mean, friends maybe?

00:58.400 --> 01:03.610
But to me, we've become like a
close, but very strange family.

01:03.640 --> 01:06.960
And without you...
I wouldn't be me.

01:06.990 --> 01:08.240
Us! Us! Us! Us!

01:08.270 --> 01:09.310
UU-U-U-Us!

01:09.340 --> 01:10.760
Shut the hell up, KVN!

01:10.790 --> 01:13.100
I will never
leave you, Gary.

01:13.140 --> 01:14.660
I will be your deep space

01:14.690 --> 01:17.560
insanity avoidance
forever companion.

01:17.590 --> 01:19.210
I swear to God, KVN!

01:19.250 --> 01:22.460
Anyways, whatever happens,
wherever we go,

01:22.490 --> 01:25.800
we find each other
when this is over.

01:25.840 --> 01:27.080
Deal?

01:27.120 --> 01:34.500
♪♪

01:34.540 --> 01:42.240
♪♪

01:42.270 --> 01:49.930
♪♪

01:49.970 --> 01:57.700
♪♪

02:01.910 --> 02:05.150
♪♪

02:05.190 --> 02:06.600
There are too many, Gary.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.980
We'll never be able
to break through.

02:08.020 --> 02:09.500
H.U.E.,
can't you find a way?

02:09.540 --> 02:12.060
We can create
a Level 4 Particle Burn.

02:12.090 --> 02:14.160
Great. While I bust out
my chemistry set,

02:14.200 --> 02:15.890
how about explaining
what the hell that means?!

02:15.920 --> 02:18.890
It means we eject
our lightfold core...

02:18.930 --> 02:20.380
and detonate it.What?!

02:20.410 --> 02:23.310
Your great idea is to explode
our lightfold engine?!

02:23.350 --> 02:25.110
Ooo-whoa.

02:28.110 --> 02:29.280
H.U.E., eject the --

02:29.320 --> 02:30.700
[ Rattling ]

02:31.220 --> 02:32.220
Done, Gary.

02:32.250 --> 02:33.560
Seriously?

02:33.600 --> 02:35.910
I mean, next time,
can you warn me first?

02:35.940 --> 02:37.320
Gary...

02:37.360 --> 02:39.220
there is no "next time."

02:39.260 --> 02:41.360
♪♪

02:41.400 --> 02:45.090
Detonating in 3...2...

02:45.130 --> 02:46.510
What is that?

02:46.540 --> 02:47.960
[ Electricity crackles ]...Boomtown.

02:52.340 --> 02:54.200
[ Crashing ]

02:55.450 --> 02:58.210
[ Explosions, crashes continue ]

03:01.250 --> 03:03.590
[ Woosh ]

03:03.630 --> 03:05.730
H.U.E.,
full speed toward the breach.

03:05.770 --> 03:08.110
We got a freakin' hole
to close.

03:08.150 --> 03:19.120
♪♪

03:19.160 --> 03:20.230
Is this fun?

03:20.260 --> 03:22.090
It is!
It is fun!

03:22.130 --> 03:25.270
♪♪

03:25.300 --> 03:27.440
[ Echoing explosions ]

03:27.480 --> 03:29.410
Release the hives.

03:29.450 --> 03:30.790
[ Retches ]

03:30.830 --> 03:33.280
[ Gasps ]
Crush them!

03:34.450 --> 03:37.280
[ Swarm buzzing ]

03:37.320 --> 03:38.870
♪♪

03:38.900 --> 03:40.910
H.U.E.:
Shields up, Gary.

03:40.940 --> 03:42.150
H.U.E.,
what the crap is that?

03:42.180 --> 03:44.700
The Lord Commander's
hive ships, Gary.

03:44.740 --> 03:46.050
If they eat through the shields,

03:46.080 --> 03:48.080
there will be
nothing left to stop them.

03:48.120 --> 03:49.640
How long will
the shields hold?

03:49.670 --> 03:52.810
Shield Integrity
is at 79% and dropping.

03:52.850 --> 03:55.400
That's like a --
That's like a B-minus!

03:55.440 --> 03:57.130
We're still good!

03:57.990 --> 03:59.890
[ Beeping ]Now at 63%.

03:59.920 --> 04:02.790
Oh, crap! That's,
like, a D, at best!

04:02.820 --> 04:05.140
KVN, if you don't get
on the outside turret,

04:05.170 --> 04:07.280
I will beat you within
one inch of your life.

04:07.310 --> 04:10.620
Guys, I'm the most expendable!
Congratulations to me.

04:10.660 --> 04:12.320
Mooncake,
what are you doing?

04:12.350 --> 04:14.280
Chookity pok.

04:14.320 --> 04:15.840
[ Sighs ]

04:15.870 --> 04:18.700
All right.
But you're not expendable.

04:21.360 --> 04:22.910
[ Buzzing ]

04:22.950 --> 04:25.160
H.U.E.: Gary, the hives
have breached the shield.

04:25.190 --> 04:28.820
KVN and Mooncake won't be able
to hold them off for long.

04:28.850 --> 04:30.750
The odds of getting
to the bomb to the breach

04:30.780 --> 04:32.750
are now nearly impossible.

04:32.780 --> 04:34.130
S.A.M.E.S.:
Oh, no! Oh, no!

04:34.170 --> 04:36.930
This isn't a fight.
It's a death sentence.

04:36.960 --> 04:38.310
Can a Hawk punch
through the hive?

04:38.340 --> 04:40.860
H.U.E.: Provided there
is sufficient force, yes.

04:40.900 --> 04:42.210
Then we will
load the anti-matter bomb

04:42.240 --> 04:43.860
onto a Hawk and use that.

04:43.900 --> 04:46.110
But as soon as the
drones see the Hawk,
they'll destroy it.

04:46.140 --> 04:48.660
Not if we send somebody
out first to clear the way.

04:50.180 --> 04:51.360
I'll do it.

04:51.390 --> 04:52.870
This is no job for a kid.

04:52.910 --> 04:55.980
I don't see a kid anymore.
I see a Man-Cat.

04:56.010 --> 04:58.120
Quinn, I can do this.

04:58.150 --> 04:59.950
We will go
with Little Cato.

04:59.980 --> 05:01.710
So that he doesn't
die like his father.

05:01.740 --> 05:03.230
Whoops, that was
insensitive.

05:03.260 --> 05:04.400
Sorry.

05:06.270 --> 05:08.540
Make us proud.

05:08.580 --> 05:09.960
H.U.E., get him a Hawk.

05:09.990 --> 05:12.000
Be careful out there,
Man-Cat.

05:12.030 --> 05:14.170
Don't worry. I got this.

05:14.210 --> 05:15.660
I so got this.

05:15.690 --> 05:17.660
[ Fading ]
I got this so good.

05:17.690 --> 05:20.070
Oooh, I got it.
I'm gonna get this...

05:20.110 --> 05:22.420
[ Buzzing ]

05:23.660 --> 05:24.660
[ Shoop ]

05:24.700 --> 05:27.010
[ Electrical whirring ]

05:28.880 --> 05:30.950
All right,
it's ready to go.

05:32.430 --> 05:33.710
[ Woosh ]

05:35.780 --> 05:38.370
To think, that's the only
thing stopping the Earth

05:38.400 --> 05:39.750
from getting swallowed up.

05:39.780 --> 05:41.340
And it's all on me.

05:41.370 --> 05:43.200
I thought it would've
looked much cooler.

05:43.230 --> 05:44.750
Should I draw
some flames on it?

05:44.790 --> 05:46.580
I brought various tubes
of this.

05:46.620 --> 05:48.410
No! How about you don't
draw flames

05:48.450 --> 05:49.520
on the anti-matter bomb?!

05:49.550 --> 05:51.100
Is it too late?

05:51.140 --> 05:53.140
[ Whispering ]
It is.

05:55.250 --> 05:58.350
-What if I can't do it?
-Try your best.

05:58.390 --> 06:00.940
What if my best
isn't good enough?

06:00.980 --> 06:02.390
It's good enough for me.

06:03.120 --> 06:05.770
Have I made things
better?

06:05.810 --> 06:07.360
I did!

06:07.400 --> 06:08.880
It's go time.

06:10.300 --> 06:12.440
-What are you doing?
-Finishing the job.

06:12.470 --> 06:14.750
Except I'm the one
taking it to the breach.

06:14.780 --> 06:16.790
It's my mission.
-Too bad.

06:16.820 --> 06:19.060
It's my destiny.

06:21.820 --> 06:23.210
Why are you fighting me?

06:23.240 --> 06:26.210
Because I can take anything,
except losing you!

06:26.240 --> 06:30.250
Oh, God, why, Quinn?!
Why are we in this situation?!

06:30.280 --> 06:33.110
From the moment I discovered
the gravitational disturbance,

06:33.150 --> 06:35.150
I knew this
was my life's work.

06:35.180 --> 06:38.150
If you really have
feelings for me...

06:38.190 --> 06:40.120
let me see this
through to the end.

06:40.150 --> 06:42.430
I am genuinely
perplexed here!

06:42.470 --> 06:44.160
[ Ship rumbles ]

06:44.190 --> 06:47.540
'Cause I'm -- I'm trying
to stop you from dying.

06:47.570 --> 06:49.300
Please.

06:50.850 --> 06:52.300
Then, Quinn Ergon,

06:52.340 --> 06:56.720
I will use every last breath
to make sure you succeed.

06:56.760 --> 06:59.340
That's a real, raw promise.

07:00.000 --> 07:01.970
Hwa!
Mmm.

07:03.490 --> 07:04.730
Hell...
Hell, yeah!

07:04.760 --> 07:06.420
More of that
when you come back.

07:06.460 --> 07:07.490
Don't die on me.

07:07.530 --> 07:10.290
Funny, I thought
I was gonna be the hero...

07:10.320 --> 07:11.910
but it's you.

07:11.940 --> 07:14.740
No, it's both of us.

07:14.770 --> 07:17.360
Always has been.

07:20.640 --> 07:22.580
[ Hive buzzing ]

07:22.610 --> 07:24.020
[ Buttons click, beep ]

07:24.060 --> 07:25.540
[ Thrusters humming ]

07:27.410 --> 07:29.550
Punch a hole for me, boys!

07:34.410 --> 07:37.560
Okay, guys,
all together now.

07:43.390 --> 07:45.870
-Thanks, Little Cato.
-Finish it, Quinn.

07:45.910 --> 07:49.950
♪♪

07:49.980 --> 07:51.980
If only there was
more help to call on.

07:52.020 --> 07:53.780
If only there was a resistance.

07:53.810 --> 07:57.710
Wait, there is a resistance,
and I'm its leader.

07:57.750 --> 08:00.650
Resistance?
Is it time to resist? It is!

08:00.680 --> 08:03.340
This is
General Tribore Menendez.

08:03.370 --> 08:05.720
All battalions to Sector 11.

08:05.760 --> 08:07.170
Reeeeorr!

08:07.210 --> 08:08.620
Reeeeorr!

08:08.660 --> 08:09.730
Reeeeorr!

08:09.760 --> 08:11.070
Reeeeorr!

08:11.110 --> 08:12.560
Reeeeorr!

08:12.590 --> 08:15.520
H.U.E.: The hives have
infiltrated the Galaxy One.

08:16.700 --> 08:18.080
Hey!

08:18.110 --> 08:19.910
Get off my ship!

08:19.940 --> 08:22.320
Aaahhhh!

08:22.360 --> 08:25.120
[ Drones buzzing, splattering ]

08:29.780 --> 08:31.370
[ Explosion ]

08:33.200 --> 08:35.130
[ Explosion ]

08:37.410 --> 08:40.100
Is this what death
feels like? [ Whirs ]

08:40.140 --> 08:42.760
Not bad.
It's just weird.

08:42.790 --> 08:44.100
Closing in.

08:45.310 --> 08:48.210
Ah! Am I alone here?

08:48.250 --> 08:50.730
No. Tribore's here.

08:50.770 --> 08:54.670
And I brought some
special friends.

08:54.700 --> 08:56.220
Ahh!

08:57.910 --> 08:59.260
Thanks, Tribore.

08:59.290 --> 09:01.540
I'm closing in
on the breach.

09:05.330 --> 09:08.270
Is this bad?
It sure the hell is!

09:09.230 --> 09:12.410
No, Tribore.
I loved you.

09:12.440 --> 09:13.960
Who's leading
the resistance now?

09:14.000 --> 09:16.690
I am. First order
of business --

09:16.720 --> 09:18.590
revenge.

09:18.620 --> 09:20.870
♪♪

09:20.900 --> 09:22.320
Eject!

09:27.350 --> 09:29.360
[ Pipes clank ]

09:30.910 --> 09:32.570
[ Gun cocks ]

09:32.600 --> 09:35.810
KVN: Yes.
Two at once! Nice shot.

09:35.850 --> 09:38.950
Down you go!
Gotcha! Gotcha! Gotcha.

09:38.990 --> 09:40.230
[ Drones buzzing ]

09:40.260 --> 09:41.850
Wow!
I'm impressed with myself.

09:43.680 --> 09:45.750
[ Gasps ]
Ooh.

09:46.680 --> 09:49.000
Hey, Gary?
-What is it, KVN?!

09:49.030 --> 09:50.620
[ Electricity crackles ]

09:50.650 --> 09:53.170
-It's been fun, right?
-Oh! KVN!

09:53.210 --> 09:54.930
I guess? Hey!

09:54.970 --> 09:56.690
[ Breaking down ]
I had fun...

09:58.700 --> 10:00.770
It's so beautiful.

10:02.980 --> 10:07.840
Call back the hives and
ready the dimension splitter.

10:07.880 --> 10:11.540
[ Muffled Lasers, explosions ]

10:11.570 --> 10:14.510
♪♪

10:14.540 --> 10:15.580
Chookity!

10:17.470 --> 10:19.230
[ Electrical hum ]Ooh...

10:20.990 --> 10:22.440
Mooncake!

10:22.480 --> 10:23.310
No!

10:23.340 --> 10:24.830
[ Shink! ]Ah!

10:24.860 --> 10:27.620
Uh!

10:27.660 --> 10:29.930
[ Moaning ]

10:29.970 --> 10:31.040
[ Drones buzzing ]

10:31.070 --> 10:32.590
Ohhh...

10:34.840 --> 10:36.220
Chookity pok!

10:36.250 --> 10:37.700
[ Electricity crackles ]

10:37.740 --> 10:43.050
The more you resist,
the stronger the trap becomes.

10:43.090 --> 10:45.710
Lord Commander:
[ Maniacally ] Hey, Mooncake...

10:45.740 --> 10:50.710
We're going to have
a lot of fun.

10:50.750 --> 10:55.030
A.I.: Approaching breach.Here goes everything.

10:55.060 --> 10:56.750
[ Ship rattling ]

10:57.760 --> 10:59.240
[ Electricity crackling,
alarms beeping ]

10:59.270 --> 11:01.860
[ Explosion ]

11:01.900 --> 11:03.690
[ Quinn groans ]

11:03.730 --> 11:04.970
Ugh![ Beeps ]

11:08.010 --> 11:11.420
[ Wooshing ]Aaah!

11:14.080 --> 11:15.980
♪♪

11:16.020 --> 11:19.230
[ Siren blaring ]

11:19.260 --> 11:22.230
[ Gary groaning ]

11:22.260 --> 11:23.090
[ Siren stops ]

11:23.130 --> 11:25.610
[ Grunts ]

11:25.650 --> 11:26.990
Ugh...

11:27.030 --> 11:28.960
Agh!

11:30.310 --> 11:31.760
Ughh!

11:31.790 --> 11:32.860
[ Metallic clink ]

11:32.890 --> 11:35.760
[ Groans ]
Status report.

11:35.790 --> 11:37.350
[ Electrical hum ]

11:37.380 --> 11:40.450
H.U.E.: Gary, we have lost
the Galaxy One.

11:40.490 --> 11:41.940
We still have
a left pulse engine.

11:41.970 --> 11:43.730
It is the right
pulse engine,

11:43.770 --> 11:47.010
and it is not enough
to face the Lord Commander.

11:47.050 --> 11:50.460
Gary, there's one option
you haven't considered.

11:50.500 --> 11:52.470
You can abandon ship.

11:52.500 --> 11:54.880
I'm not running away.
Not this time.

11:54.920 --> 11:56.920
At one point,
that made sense, but...

11:56.950 --> 11:58.710
I'm not
that guy anymore.

11:58.750 --> 12:00.300
I'd give you a cookie.

12:00.340 --> 12:02.200
But I think you've
outgrown that now.

12:02.230 --> 12:03.270
What?!

12:03.300 --> 12:04.860
No! Give me a cookie!

12:04.890 --> 12:06.790
I will never, ever
outgrow a cookie!

12:06.820 --> 12:09.100
I'm sorry, Gary,
but they're gone.

12:09.140 --> 12:10.760
All gone.

12:10.790 --> 12:12.310
That sucks, H.U.E.!

12:12.350 --> 12:14.560
It...really does, Gary.

12:14.590 --> 12:16.560
We can't let
this guy win.

12:16.590 --> 12:18.490
Gary, I know that look.

12:18.530 --> 12:20.560
Reconsider. Please.

12:20.600 --> 12:24.290
No way, José.
I won't reconsider.

12:24.320 --> 12:25.980
[ Beep ]
[ Siren resumes ]

12:26.020 --> 12:29.160
Gary, you have set a collision
course directly for

12:29.190 --> 12:31.570
the Lord Commander's
Heavy Incinerator.

12:31.610 --> 12:32.990
[ Groans ]

12:33.020 --> 12:35.340
It's the only the way to stop
him from taking out Quinn.

12:35.370 --> 12:36.790
And I have to save Mooncake.

12:36.820 --> 12:39.790
Do I really have to make
a list for you right now?!

12:39.820 --> 12:42.520
If we're going out,
we're going out big.

12:42.550 --> 12:43.760
Agreed.

12:43.790 --> 12:45.170
We must do
everything possible

12:45.210 --> 12:46.970
to destroy
that dick loaf.

12:47.000 --> 12:49.940
What do you say
we make an entrance?

12:49.970 --> 12:52.320
Right pulse engine
is a go.

12:52.350 --> 12:53.770
[ Engine humming faintly ]

12:55.740 --> 12:57.010
What?

12:57.050 --> 12:59.460
What is he trying to
accomplish?! [ Retches ]

12:59.500 --> 13:01.360
He's already lost everything.

13:01.400 --> 13:03.360
[ Rattling ]

13:03.400 --> 13:07.090
Computer: Proximity alert!
Proximity alert!

13:07.130 --> 13:07.920
Fire!

13:07.950 --> 13:11.160
Rip that ship from space!

13:11.200 --> 13:12.720
[ Alarm blaring ]

13:12.750 --> 13:19.660
♪♪

13:19.690 --> 13:26.630
♪♪

13:26.660 --> 13:33.570
♪♪

13:33.600 --> 13:36.710
[ Lasers ricocheting ]

13:38.260 --> 13:39.400
Uhh!
[Thud]

13:39.430 --> 13:43.230
I wish killing you
could last a lifetime.

13:43.270 --> 13:45.410
♪♪

13:45.440 --> 13:46.650
Ready for your turn?

13:46.680 --> 13:49.240
Get on with it!

13:49.270 --> 13:53.310
Aaaah!

13:53.340 --> 14:01.180
♪♪

14:01.210 --> 14:08.880
♪♪

14:08.910 --> 14:14.260
H.U.E.: [ Echoing, muffled ]
Gary, the Galaxy One...

14:14.300 --> 14:16.920
is destroyed...

14:16.950 --> 14:19.540
H.U.E., quick!
Transfer your AI into my helmet.

14:19.580 --> 14:21.030
No, no, no. H.U.E.!

14:21.060 --> 14:22.130
H.U.E.?!

14:23.130 --> 14:24.890
H.U.E.!

14:24.930 --> 14:26.170
H.U.E.:
Yes, Gary. I'm here.

14:26.210 --> 14:28.760
Oh, my gosh.
Don't ever leave me, H.U.E.

14:28.790 --> 14:30.620
Wouldn't think of it, Gary.
-Chookity!

14:30.660 --> 14:34.830
[ Mooncake whimpering ]

14:41.770 --> 14:43.390
[ Gary grunts ]

14:43.430 --> 14:47.090
Computer:
Final Space Dimension Splitter
has been armed.

14:47.120 --> 14:50.300
15 seconds until activation.[ Retching ]

14:51.470 --> 14:53.650
[ Mooncake whimpering ]

14:53.680 --> 14:54.720
Mooncake!

14:54.750 --> 14:56.890
Here he is...

14:56.930 --> 14:59.930
the infamous hero!

14:59.960 --> 15:01.590
The Gary!

15:01.620 --> 15:03.730
Just Gary!

15:03.760 --> 15:06.380
Yes -- [heaves] --
just The Gary.

15:06.420 --> 15:09.040
Let him go!
He's done nothing to you!

15:09.080 --> 15:12.600
You're just in time
to see Mooncake...

15:12.630 --> 15:17.390
[ Electricity crackles ]...open the doorway
of Final Space.

15:17.430 --> 15:18.500
[ Whimpering ]

15:18.530 --> 15:21.330
Hang tight, little buddy!

15:21.360 --> 15:22.810
[ Groans ]

15:22.850 --> 15:26.580
[ Howling ]

15:26.610 --> 15:30.860
[ Electricity crackling ]

15:30.890 --> 15:33.000
[ Distressed ]
Chookity!

15:34.200 --> 15:35.900
[ Woosh ]

15:37.380 --> 15:39.620
Ugh!

15:39.660 --> 15:43.800
[ Echoing ] Can't you see?
There is no one beside you.

15:43.830 --> 15:47.180
Avocato, his son,
your crew?

15:47.220 --> 15:50.880
Everyone you've
cared about is gone!

15:50.910 --> 15:52.980
All because of that!

15:53.020 --> 15:56.090
And now, yourlife ends.

15:56.120 --> 15:58.090
But nothing quick.

15:58.120 --> 15:59.850
I want you to experience

15:59.880 --> 16:03.130
the same pain
you put me through.

16:03.160 --> 16:06.370
A slow, painful death.[ Rumbling woosh ]

16:06.410 --> 16:09.170
[ Straining ]
You don't get it, do you?

16:09.200 --> 16:12.690
The good guys
win in the end!

16:12.730 --> 16:13.730
They always do.

16:13.760 --> 16:14.900
No.

16:14.930 --> 16:17.520
Not this time, The Gary.

16:17.560 --> 16:19.150
Don't do this, Jack.

16:19.180 --> 16:21.220
Why would you
call me that?

16:21.250 --> 16:22.530
[ Frenzied ]
Speak!

16:22.560 --> 16:23.910
You used to like taquitos

16:23.940 --> 16:26.150
and hanging out
with my dad, man.

16:26.190 --> 16:28.120
Ahh.

16:28.150 --> 16:30.920
John Goodspeed's son.

16:30.950 --> 16:33.850
Well...that changes nothing!

16:33.880 --> 16:35.990
You don't need
to do this, Jack.

16:36.020 --> 16:37.920
Stop calling me that!

16:37.960 --> 16:41.930
That person died
the day I was chosen.

16:41.960 --> 16:44.030
Can I be honest,
with the likelihood

16:44.070 --> 16:46.030
of pissing you off
a little bit?

16:46.070 --> 16:47.660
I don't think
you were chosen.

16:47.690 --> 16:51.250
You getting these powers
was just a mistake.

16:51.280 --> 16:52.700
Mistake?!

16:52.730 --> 16:56.940
Rraaaaahh!Aaahh!

16:56.980 --> 17:02.090
♪♪

17:02.120 --> 17:06.950
Now, let's take a look
at what's inside Final Space.

17:06.990 --> 17:09.060
[ Mooncake whimpering ]

17:09.090 --> 17:11.920
[ Shrieks ]

17:16.750 --> 17:18.860
[ Quinn groaning ]

17:18.890 --> 17:20.450
[ Gasps ]

17:20.480 --> 17:21.970
[ Straining ]

17:24.310 --> 17:25.630
[ Gasps ]

17:25.660 --> 17:27.460
Aaah!

17:27.490 --> 17:30.800
Lord Commander:
The time has come!

17:30.840 --> 17:31.910
Yes!

17:31.940 --> 17:33.390
[ Ominous snarl ]

17:34.740 --> 17:36.600
Take me!

17:37.840 --> 17:40.120
I'm ready to be a Titan

17:40.160 --> 17:45.090
and rule every dimension!

17:46.090 --> 17:47.580
No! No!

17:47.610 --> 17:50.820
Nooo!

17:50.860 --> 17:52.930
[ Smashing ]

17:52.960 --> 18:02.280
♪♪

18:02.320 --> 18:04.290
[ Beep ]Quinn: Gary?

18:04.320 --> 18:05.110
Quinn.

18:05.150 --> 18:07.120
I'm sorry.

18:07.150 --> 18:08.770
For...what?

18:08.810 --> 18:10.460
Not telling you sooner.

18:10.500 --> 18:12.330
You can tell me
when you come back.

18:12.360 --> 18:13.640
Gary...

18:13.670 --> 18:15.680
No, don't...

18:15.710 --> 18:18.020
Don't say it.

18:18.060 --> 18:20.060
I'm not coming back.

18:22.340 --> 18:23.370
Quinn.

18:24.370 --> 18:27.140
We've lost the Earth,
but I can still save you.

18:27.170 --> 18:29.550
Goodbye, Gary.

18:32.550 --> 18:34.280
I'll miss you.

18:35.830 --> 18:39.080
[ Rumbling ]

18:41.810 --> 18:43.190
Quinn?!

18:47.290 --> 18:49.540
You have got to be kidding.

18:49.570 --> 18:51.260
[ Retches ]

18:51.300 --> 18:54.160
[ Mooncake whimpers ]

18:54.200 --> 18:57.060
H.U.E., get her back.
Co-Come on.

18:57.100 --> 18:58.890
Quinn!

18:58.930 --> 19:00.310
H.U.E., get her back!

19:02.690 --> 19:04.210
Quinn!

19:07.380 --> 19:15.980
♪♪

19:16.010 --> 19:18.840
Gary:
H.U.E., what are my chances
of getting out of this mess?

19:18.880 --> 19:20.080
H.U.E.:
In your current state,

19:20.120 --> 19:21.980
you will pass
the point of recovery

19:22.020 --> 19:24.470
in 10 minutes...

19:24.500 --> 19:25.810
9 minutes...

19:25.850 --> 19:27.200
8...

19:27.230 --> 19:28.060
7...

19:28.090 --> 19:29.650
Look, it's Carl.

19:29.680 --> 19:31.540
6...It can't be...

19:31.580 --> 19:32.580
5...

19:32.610 --> 19:34.170
4...

19:34.200 --> 19:35.550
3...

19:35.580 --> 19:36.930
2...

19:36.960 --> 19:40.550
The cookies will be
done in one minute.

19:40.590 --> 19:42.110
[ Faintly ]
Oh, good.

19:42.140 --> 19:44.700
I'm extremely excited...

19:44.730 --> 19:46.210
for these cookies.

19:46.250 --> 19:47.730
Zero.

19:47.770 --> 19:50.530
Gary, the cookies are done.

19:50.560 --> 19:54.600
[ Gasps faintly ]

19:56.400 --> 19:59.090
♪♪

19:59.120 --> 20:01.260
I'll miss you, friend.

20:01.300 --> 20:08.270
♪♪

20:08.310 --> 20:15.350
♪♪

20:15.380 --> 20:16.800
Hey, son.

20:16.830 --> 20:18.420
Holy crap.

20:18.450 --> 20:19.630
Am I dreaming?

20:19.660 --> 20:20.700
No.
Oh.

20:20.730 --> 20:23.250
Well.
Then...I'm...

20:23.290 --> 20:24.360
Yep.

20:24.390 --> 20:26.050
Well, crap,
that's not good.

20:26.080 --> 20:28.080
You see, I was --
I was hoping for a no.

20:28.120 --> 20:30.220
I was sent to give you
a choice --

20:30.260 --> 20:32.470
to come with me
or to go back.

20:32.500 --> 20:34.540
What's...that way?

20:34.570 --> 20:37.270
Lots, and I mean
lots, of imported beer.

20:37.300 --> 20:40.890
It's actually ridiculous.How much beer are we talking?

20:40.920 --> 20:42.650
Too much.

20:42.680 --> 20:44.270
And back that way?

20:44.310 --> 20:47.170
A perilous journey full
of death and heartbreak.

20:47.340 --> 20:51.620
Which way
is Little Cato?

20:51.660 --> 20:54.830
Which way is Mooncake?

20:54.870 --> 20:57.290
Which way is Quinn?

20:57.320 --> 21:04.670
♪♪

21:04.710 --> 21:12.300
♪♪

21:12.340 --> 21:19.650
♪♪

21:19.690 --> 21:27.040
♪♪

21:27.070 --> 21:34.910
♪♪
